          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "C76E71C6C3591663",
      "text": "¿Quieres enfrentarte a la Líder de Gimnasio\\nLima, la mismísima Alma del Rap?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "C76E72C6C3591816",
      "text": "Muy bien, permíteme acompañarte a la arena de\\ncombate.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "C76E73C6C35919C9",
      "text": "Avísame cuando estés list[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa, no hay prisa.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_receptionist_nobattle",
      "hash64": "D0A496BAB24C009D",
      "text": "¡Vaya! Debes llevar al menos dos Pokémon en\\ncondiciones de combatir para desafiar a Lima.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_man_00",
      "hash64": "F4F1D404F7C6E265",
      "text": "Yo, yo!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_system_01",
      "hash64": "CDB670A9B4004749",
      "text": "Puedes oír un habla rítmica proveniente de\\nla arena de combate.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_man_01",
      "hash64": "F4F1D304F7C6E0B2",
      "text": "♪Se acabaron tus días, llegó quien te la lía.\\nEn una pelea de gallos, nada pintan gallinas.♪\\c\\n♪¿Qué pasa, lideresa? ¿Quieres salir ilesa?\\nDeja que te intimide, que mi rap te atemorice.♪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_man_02",
      "hash64": "F4F1D204F7C6DEFF",
      "text": "♪Pregúntale a mi jefe, que me tiene en un altar.\\nTe dirá que soy la leche, el que le vende más.♪\\c\\n♪Deleitaos con mi rima, que al público jalea.\\nAquí dejo mi firma, el rapero de Paldea.♪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_system_02",
      "hash64": "CDB66DA9B4004230",
      "text": "Bum, bum, chas... Bum, bum, chas...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_01",
      "hash64": "1436B0F9B1C26717",
      "text": "♪No me vendas la moto, sé de qué va tu rollo.\\nSi curras como rimas, raro es que ahí aún sigas.♪\\c\\n♪Permite que te diga que tus rimas no intimidan.\\nPerdiste la rencilla, así que largo, piltrafilla.♪[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 198,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_02",
      "hash64": "1436B1F9B1C268CA",
      "text": "♪Peleas contra Lima, no esperes salir con vida.\\n¿Todavía no lo pillas? A mí nadie me vacila.♪[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_03",
      "hash64": "1436B2F9B1C26A7D",
      "text": "♪Tu rima es un peñazo, pa tirarla al inodoro.\\nTe lo dice la gallina que pone huevos de oro.♪[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_system_03",
      "hash64": "CDB66EA9B40043E3",
      "text": "Bum, bum, chas... Bum, bum, chas...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_man_03",
      "hash64": "F4F1D104F7C6DD4C",
      "text": "♪Vaya rimas las de Lima, toca parar el asunto.\\nMe piro a currar, tía. Réplica a las tres ¡y punto!♪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_04",
      "hash64": "1436ABF9B1C25E98",
      "text": "♪¿Pero cómo que te piras y así dejas la batalla?\\nAnda, déjate de cuentos, ven aquí y da la talla.♪\\c\\nBah, me ha cortado el rollo.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_05",
      "hash64": "1436ACF9B1C2604B",
      "text": "Qué pena me da que no sean más atrevidos...\\nAl final mucho cacarean y no ponen un huevo.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_06",
      "hash64": "1436ADF9B1C261FE",
      "text": "¿Hm?[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_07",
      "hash64": "1436AEF9B1C263B1",
      "text": "¡Pero si es mi teloner[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa! ¿Qué tal te va?\\n¿Vienes a desafiarme a un combate o a rapear?[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_select_01",
      "hash64": "0E65523F48A7AD8E",
      "text": "¡He venido a combatir!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_select_02",
      "hash64": "0E65513F48A7ABDB",
      "text": "¡He venido a rapear!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_08",
      "hash64": "1436A7F9B1C257CC",
      "text": "♪¿Eres un verso suelto, no te atreves con el rap?\\nRollo \"paso, ni lo intento, menuda dificultad\".♪[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_09",
      "hash64": "1436A8F9B1C2597F",
      "text": "♪Qué pedazo bromista, ¡ey, tú rebosas carisma!\\nNo te perderé de vista, a ver si te haces artista.♪[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_10",
      "hash64": "143A35F9B1C57EED",
      "text": "¿Hm? ¿Que por qué hablo tan raro, dices?[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_11",
      "hash64": "143A34F9B1C57D3A",
      "text": "¡Llevo el rap en las venas!\\c\\nEl ritmo, la rima, la letra... ¡Todo eso es lo que le\\nda al rap su alma![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 103,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_12",
      "hash64": "143A33F9B1C57B87",
      "text": "♪Sableye parte cual flecha, ¡se va a toda mecha!\\nEmpieza su aventura, qué pasote y qué locura.♪\\c\\n¡O algo por el estilo! ¿Lo pillas?[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_13",
      "hash64": "143A32F9B1C579D4",
      "text": "Bueno, tú eres Entrenador[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]a Pokémon.\\n¡Puedes mostrarme tu espíritu en un combate![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_14",
      "hash64": "143A31F9B1C57821",
      "text": "Me gano el pan como rapera sobre todo, pero\\neso no significa que sea nula en los combates.\\c\\nNadie conoce a los Pokémon de tipo Fantasma\\nmejor que la menda.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 157,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_15",
      "hash64": "143A30F9B1C5766E",
      "text": "Por si no te has coscado ya, ¡me llamo Lima! Pero\\nla mayoría me conoce como el Alma del Rap.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_16",
      "hash64": "143A2FF9B1C574BB",
      "text": "¿List[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa para un poco de marcha? ¡Avivemos esto\\ncon una batalla que estremezca el alma![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_17",
      "hash64": "143A2EF9B1C57308",
      "text": "¡Ja, ja, ja! ¡Te sales! ¡Me has hecho sentir más viva\\nque nunca![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_18",
      "hash64": "143A2DF9B1C57155",
      "text": "¡Tienes el alma bien puesta, tí[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa!\\nTe has ganado esta Medalla de Gimnasio.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_19",
      "hash64": "143A2CF9B1C56FA2",
      "text": "Ya que estamos, cuando vengas a verme actuar,\\nme aseguraré de que te den asientos de primera.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_badge",
      "hash64": "0D82A4DAAE6440AF",
      "text": "Con [VAR 0x0200(0001)] medallita[VAR 0x1101(0001,0100)]s, podrás atrapar Pokémon de\\nNv. [VAR 0x0201(0002)] o menos más fácilmente, ¡y además harán\\r\\ncaso a lo que les digas![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0200",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
